{1}{[ NOUVELLES D'ARCANUM ]}
{2}{Prix 2 pièces}
{3}{La meilleure source d'informations d'Arcanum}

// News Paper Type 2
{4}{[ TIMES ]}
{5}{All the News That is Fit to Print}

// filler articles
{10}{492c _ CALADON _}
{11}{483l Sir Evelyn Baring rentrera à Caladon via Cendrebourg le 6 de ce mois. Pendant son absence, M Portal sera responsable du bureau diplomatique de Tarante.}
{12}{492c _ UN TRAIN ATTAQUE _}
{13}{483l Dans les Landes de Morbiliande, un train fut attaqué par des voleurs qui s'enfuirent en empruntant 15000 pièces volés dans ce train express.}
{14}{492c _ APPEL A LA POPULATION _}
{15}{483l La police de Cendrebourg invinte la population à communiquer tous rensei- gnements concernant les récents évènements de Whitechapel. Anonymat garanti.}
{16}{492c _ NOUVEAU PERIODIQUE _}
{17}{483l Le premier numéro de vérité et mensonges, bi-mensuel consacré à ce que son comité de rédaction appelle la "libre pensée" est sorti des presses aujourd'hui. Le maire de Cendrebourg en a ordonné la saisie.}
{18}{492c _ UNIVERSITY COLLOQUIUM SERIES _}
{19}{483l The Engineering School of the University of Tarant is holding a Distinguished Speaker Series this semester. Interested parties are invited to contact the University Registrar for more Information.}
{20}{492c _ CHARITY BALL _}
{21}{483l The Ladies Society of Tarant will once again hold a Charity Ball this Saturday evening. This Event will benefit Orphans and Survivors of Foreign Wars. Festivities will begin at 8pm. Strict dress code will be enforced.}
{22}{492c _ TIDAL FIGURES _}
{23}{483l High tides will occur at 6:15am and 7:30pm today, with low tides at approximately 1:05pm and 25 minutes after midnight. Full tidal charts can be found on page 8.}
{24}{492c _ TIDAL FIGURES _}
{25}{483l High tides will occur at 6:15am and 7:30pm today, with low tides at approximately 1:05pm and 25 minutes after midnight. Full tidal charts can be found on page 8.}

